<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOL" style="id">Joel</book>
  <para style="h">Joel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joel</para>
  <para style="mt">Joel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi sia in Pethuel tapa Joel tungah Topa ii thupuak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khanghaamzawte awng, nadon vun; Judah ngamsung a om mihing theampo awng ngai vun. Hi bang thu peuma noma khan sung ahizong na taanghpupi te khan sung ahizong a piang ngei ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na tate tungah tua thu son vun; amate in a tate tungah sonsawn tu hi, tuate in a khang kikte tungah sonsawn tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khaumaw honkhat zawkciang honkhat in lo ante topha hi; Hon khat ii nusiat sate hon dang khat in khawng tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />No zu khamte awng, khanglo vun a kap vun; no sapittui nete awng, kap vun; sapittui thak vawt natu sapitngate kisusia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khaumaw ngalkaphonpi khat in ih ngam hong sim hi; tuate thahatin tam leih a, kisim zo ngawl hi; a hate tawpi ha bangin hiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in ih sapitkungte susia zo a, ih theikungte khimtham zo hi. Amate in thingbaakte a kaang dongin a haw khok keak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />No mite awng, a teenpui tu pa a thi ciang ngaknu khat a khuangai bangin kap vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Biakinnpi sungah piak tu antang ahibuale sapittui om ngawl hi; Topa biakpiak natu bangma nei ngawl ahikom thiampite khuangai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lote kolh hi; leitangte khuangai hi banghang ziam cile ankungte kisusia in sapitngate kikosak a, olive kungte kivulsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />No, lothote awng, khuangai vun; sapithuan cingte awng kap vun, banghang ziam cile zungtaangte, mangtaangte, ankung theampo kisusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sapitkungte le theikungte kongaw zo hi; thingnga kungte theampo vulin thi zo hi. Mite ii lungdamna bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />No, biaknatau ah naseam thiampite awng, khau-ip puan silhin kap vun! Biakinnpi sungah tumin, zankhuateak khuangai vun! Na Pathian na piak tu uh antang, ahibuale sapittui om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Antan natu thupia vun; kikhoppi khat sam vun! Lampuite le Judah mi theampo Topa na Pathian Biakinnpi sungah khawmtua in, ama ko in au vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa ni nai hi; Vaanglianbelpa ii siatna hong tunsak tu ni ahi hi. Tua ni in bangza launa piang tu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ih ante a suksiat ciang cimaw in ih en lel hi. Ih Pathian Biakinnpi sungah lungdamna om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anciite leiko sungah thi hi. Khol tu antang om ngawl hi; tua ahikom ansaal hawmte lalcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khuite ngilkialin haam uh hi, banghang ziam cile a tat natu lohing mun om ngawl hi; tuuhonte zongh in thuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa awng, nang kong ausan hi, banghang ziam cile mei ii halthap bang keakin nganthana le thingkungte kongaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Luituite kang ahikom ngamsate ngawngawn in nang hong ko uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lemle tum vun; Pathian mual thiangtho Zion tungah patau daak tum vun, Judah mite awng, liing vun! Topa ni hong theng pal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ni sia khuatuapin, a zing le meeivom kaai ni khat hi tu hi. Mualte tungah khuazing kizel bangin khaumaw ngalkaphonpi in maisang nawk hi. Hi bang peuma om ngeingawl a, om kik ngei nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Meikuang bangin tuate in ankungte netum hi. A mai sangah ngam pha in Eden Huan bang hi a, ahihang a nungsangah ngam kolhin sennealngam ahi hi. Tuate kung pan bangma suakta ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuate siphute taw kibang a; ngal siphute bangin tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mualdawnte ah a lento uh ciang siphu ngalleangte bangin nging vatel a; lopa kote mei taw hal bangin puak vatam hi. Tuate sia ngalsim tu in a kithoai ngalkap honpui khat bangin kingual uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuate a nai ciang kuama theampo lau a; a maitang theampo daang siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngalhangte bangin tuate in sim a; luphungte tungah ngalkapte bangin kaato uh hi. A vekpi ma in mai sangah tang tak nawk in, a pai natu san pial ngawl hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ahibuale khat le khat a mai kikhak ngawl uh hi. Ngal nannate kaantan vanuau in kuama in khak zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuate in khuapi bulu a; a luphungte kaantan uh hi; tuate inn tungah kaato in ngutate bangin khelkite pan tum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mai ah a manaw uh ciang lei liing a; van kilok hi. Ni le tha mial a, aksite taang nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in a ngalkaphonpi tungah vanto aw taw thupia hi. A thuni ngalkap honte tam a, thahat hi. Topa ni sia bangza in lauhuai ziam! akua suakta zo tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in “Ahihang tu mama zongh in, thintak taw kisiik kik in kei kungah an tanna, kaana le mauna taw hong heak kik tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na thin tapthapna taw in na heena lak vun; na puansilh balthapna bek sia kicing ngawl hi,” ci hi. Topa na Pathian kungah pai kik vun. Ama cingh a, hesuakna taw kidim hi; ama a thinsau a, a kamciam len hi; ama in khialna mawna maisak tu le daan piak ngawl tu in kinging tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa na Pathian in a thin kheal tha tu a, an hauna taw nang thupha hong pia tu hi. Tuasia ciang antang le sapittui te ama na pia thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zion Mual ah lemle tum vun; antan natu thupia vun a, mipi kikhop sam vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mite khawmtua vun; a thiangtho kikhop natu in kithoaisak vun; khanghaamte hong paipui tavun; patangte le nausente zongh khawmtua vun. A kiteang tuung nupate zongh a inn nusia in hong pai uh kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Biaknatau le Biakinnpi tumna kilaklaw a, Topa na a seam thiampite kapin thu a nget uh kul tu hi: “ Topa awng, na mite hesuak in. Minam dangte in, ‘Na Pathian koisung om ziam?’ ci in hong zawngsak hong nunausak heak in,” ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa in ama leitang atu thinbot a; ama in a mite hesuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in amate tungah hi bang in zo hi: “Tu in an, sapittui le olive thau kong pia tu a, na lung uh kim tu hi. Minam dangte in no hong zawngsak nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Saksang pan hong pai khaumaw honpite ka heam tu a, pawlkhatte sennealngam sungah ka hawlkeak tu hi. A mai dok ngual teng Tuipi Thi sungah, a nung ngual teng Mediterranean tuipi sungah kihawlkeak tu hi. A thisate muat in ui tu hi. Note tungah hong vawtnate hangin tuate ka susia tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Lote awng, lau heak vun, Topa hong sepsak sate hu in lungpil in lungdam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nganhingte awng lau heak vun, Ngan thana munte hing a; thingkungte a nga nga in, thei le sapitngate tam mama om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Zion mite awng, lungdam vun, Topa na Pathian ii note atu a sep sate hu in lungdam vun. Ama in tangngam ngua a khombek khat in hong pia a; ama in phalbi nguate no atu hong buaksuk in, khuapi ngua zongh hong piak ngei bang hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Taang cilna munte sia antang taw kidim tu a; thingngatui sukna hui ah leidumte sia sapittui le olive thau taw dimleet tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khaumaw honte ii na lo an hong neaktumsak kumte sungah na sup uhte kong pia kik tu hi. Hi khaumaw honpi hong puak sia keima khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu in neak tu tam mama nei in, na lung uh kim tu hi. Na lamdangte no atu hong sepsak Topa na Pathian na pok tu uh hi. Ka mite kizawnsak vawt kik ngei nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Israel awng, note sungah ka om hunlam na he tu uh hi, keima in Topa , noma ii Pathian ka hi a, Pathian dang om ngawl hi. Ka mite kizawngsak kik ngei nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tuasia zawkciang a kuama po tungah ka Thaa ka buak tu a: na tapate le tanute in ka thu thangsak tu uh hi; na khanghaamte in mang man tu uh a, na khangnote in mukholna mu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua hun in naseam nupite le pasalte tung ngawngawn ah ka Thaa ka buak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Tua ni hun atu kidop thei natu in van le lei ah limte ka pia tu a; chisan luanna, meikuang le meikhu lomte om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A lian le a lauhuai Topa ii ni hong pai ma in, ni kimialsak tu a, tha zongh chi bangin san tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahihang Topa tungah huna a ngen theampo kingum tu hi. Topa ci sa bangin ‘Jerusalem a om pawlkhatte suakta tu a; ka teal mite suakta tu uh hi.’
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Tua hun in Judah le Jerusalem puuapha in nopsakna ka pia kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Minam theampo ka khawmtua tu a, Thukhenna Kuam ah ka paipui tu hi. Ka mite tung a, a vawt na sa theampo huvau in tua munah amate thu ka khen tu hi. Amate in Israel te ngamdang ah thethaang in, ka Israel ngam khentham uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in a ngalmatte akua teng in nga tu ziam ci in, nuangtang lawnin khensat uh hi. Amate in pumpi zuakte a thapna le sapittui leina in, patangno le numeinote salin zuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tyre, Sidon le Philistia ngamkhente theampo awng, kei, bang hong law nuam nu ziam? Bang khat po hangin hong thuk kik nuamin hanciam nu ziam? Tuabang nong hi uh le keima in manlang takin kong thuk kik tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note in ka ngunn ka khamh te la in, ka sumngum manphate na biakinnte uh ah na pua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah le Jerusalem mite sia amate ngam pan a khuala mamana ah paipui in Greek te tungah na zuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu in amate na zuakna munte pan ka pui kik tu hi. Amate tung na vawt uh bangin note tungah kong vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na tapate le na tanute Judah mite tungah ka zuaksak tu a; amate in a khualana Sabean te tungah zuaksawn tu hi. Keima Topa in ka ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Minamte sungah hi thu thangsak vun: ‘Ngalsim tu in kithoai vun; na ngalhangte sam vun; na ngalkapte khawm vun a, kuan vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lo thawna thikzumte seak vun a, namsau suaksak vun, na thingno attanna namte tei sua vun. A thazawmte ngawngawn in ngalsim hamtang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Manlang in hong pai tavun, no, kiim le paam a om minamte awng, a kuam sungah kikhawm tavun,’ ci vun,” ci hi. Topa awng, amate sim tu in, na ngalkaphonpite puak suk in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Minamte kithoai in, Thukhenna Kuam ah hong pai kul tu hi. Tua munah kiim le paam minamte theampo tungah thukhen tu in keima, Topa ka to tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate seksol mama hi; anlaak hun lai ankungte saattan bangin amate saattan vun; sapitngate a tuisuukna sung dimin a tui let dong a kingoaitham bangin amate sucip vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A tul a tulin Thukhenna Kuam sungah om uh hi. Tua munah Topa ii ni hong theng pal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni le tha zing a, aksite taang nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zion mual pan Topa hawk hi; Jerusalem pan a aw vanto bangin nging a; van le lei liing hi. Ahihang ama in a mite sungsia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tuasia ciang Israel awng, keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hunlam nong he tu uh hi. Ka mual thiangtho Zion tungah ka teang hi. Jerusalem sia khuapi thiangtho khat hi tu a; ngamdangte in tuasia zothal kik ngeingawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua hun ciang mualpite sia sapithuan taw kidim tu a, mualno sim ah khuihon kimu tu hi; Judah ngamsung lui theampo atu in tui tam mama om tu hi. Topa Biakinnpi panin lui khat luang tu a, tua lui in Acacia Kuam tui pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Egypt ngam sia sennealngam khat suak tu a, Edom kisia in dui suak tu hi. Banghang ziam cile amate in Judah ngam simin mawbaang ngawl, a mite thatlum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A kithatte ii phu ka lam tu hi; a mawte ka thasua buatu hi. Ahihang Judah le Jerusalem te ah a tawntungin mihing teang tu hi, tuaciang Zion Mualtung ah keima Topa ka teang tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
</usx>
